We investigate the leptoquark $U_1$ model's implications for the decay $\Lambda_b 	o p 	au  ar{
u}$, considering the constraints from $b 	o c$ transitions. The $U_1$ model's $SU(2)_L$ nature allows for the calculation of the decay amplitude, which is found to be consistent with experimental data. The model's predictions for the decay $\Lambda_b 	o p 	au  ar{
u}$ are also in agreement with the $B 	o p 	au  ar{
u}$ decay.
